                "stem + present endings. Many strong verbs change <em>e</em> to <em>i/ie</em> or <em>a</em> to <em>ä</em> for <em>du</em> and <em>er/sie/es</em> (<em lang=\"de\">fahren → du fährst</em>; <em lang=\"de\">sehen → er sieht</em>).",
                Ich, Rows(["mach|e", "arbeit|e", "fahr|e"], ["mach|st", "arbeit|est", "fähr|st"], ["mach|t", "arbeit|et", "fähr|t"],
